<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-KEY MATCH STATISTICS OF EUROPEAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KEY MATCH STATISTICS OF EUROPEAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borussia Dortmund had three</p>
<p>attempts on target and scored three goals in their 3-1 European</p>
<p>Cup Final win over Juventus on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official statistics supplied by UEFA:</p>
<p>		Borussia Dortmund	   Juventus</p>
<p> Goals		 3			  1</p>
<p> Goal Attempts     3			 13</p>
<p> Shots wide	  5			  4</p>
<p> Corners	     5			 10</p>
<p> Free kicks	 23			 26</p>
<p> Offsides	    4			  0</p>
<p> Possession	 47 percent	     53 percent</p>
</text>
